### Create a new schedule (Interval)
POST http://localhost:3000/scheduler
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentId": 1,
  "type": "INTERVAL",
  "interval": 30,
  "metadata": {
    "input": "What is the current time?"
  }
}

### Create a new schedule (Cron)
POST http://localhost:3000/scheduler
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentId": 1,
  "type": "CRON",
  "cronExpression": "0 9 * * *",
  "timezone": "America/Los_Angeles",
  "metadata": {
    "input": "Generate a daily report"
  }
}

### Create a new schedule (Fixed time)
POST http://localhost:3000/scheduler
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentId": 1,
  "type": "FIXED",
  "fixedTime": "2024-01-10T15:00:00Z",
  "metadata": {
    "input": "Send one-time notification"
  }
}

### List all schedules
GET http://localhost:3000/scheduler

### List active schedules
GET http://localhost:3000/scheduler?enabled=true

### List schedules for specific agent
GET http://localhost:3000/scheduler?agentId=1

### Get specific schedule
GET http://localhost:3000/scheduler/1

### Pause schedule
POST http://localhost:3000/scheduler/1/pause

### Resume schedule
POST http://localhost:3000/scheduler/1/resume

### Delete schedule
DELETE http://localhost:3000/scheduler/1 